# FORLORN HOPE: the bottom-right way up. The chimney's ledges include three
# pairs of blocks, one pair for each plate, so it needs all three plates
# held. With them held (stones put on them here) and the foes away, a sapper
# at the chimney's foot climbs it with real presses and blows the heart
# chamber's east wall open; the next volunteer walks into the chamber.
game forlorn
cheat start 1
cheat no_foes
cheat bot_route 3
expect solid130171 == 0
expect solid100167 == 0
expect solid70171 == 0
cheat tile 57 36 9
cheat tile 54 6 9
cheat tile 68 44 9
botuntil phase == 1 200
cheat place 1680 1595
wait 2
expect solid130171 == 1
expect solid100167 == 1
expect solid70171 == 1
botuntil lost >= 1 6000
expect tile56158 == 0
botuntil phase == 1 200
cheat place 1640 575
botuntil x <= 1500 400
expect phase == 1
expect bottom == 580
